# Lab 81 — a hypervisor and its guest: the checks of a solution
# (python3 -m emips check docs/guide/labs/rv_hyp.asm, or Run → Check)
eMIPS: --arch rv64 --rv-ext imafdch_zicsr_zifencei_zicntr
check: output is "guest reads 42"   (no guest-page fault)
check: exceptions == 0         (the guest's second load is mapped too)
check: $a0 == 42               (and reads the same page)
